{"id":"passive-continuous-get","lv":"b2","n":14,"cat":"passive","t":"Being done, get + V3 và bị động hai tân ngữ","en":"is being repaired · got stolen · I was given…","sum":"Bị động tiếp diễn: is / are / was / were being + V3 — việc ĐANG được làm: My car is being repaired. The road was being fixed when we arrived. Get + V3: bị động thân mật, nhấn vào chuyện xảy ra, thường bất ngờ hay không may (get stolen, get hurt, get lost) hoặc thay đổi (get married, get paid). Động từ hai tân ngữ (give, offer, send): để NGƯỜI NHẬN làm chủ ngữ nghe tự nhiên hơn: I was given a free coffee. She was offered a job.","forms":[{"f":"is / are being + V3 = đang được làm","vi":"My car is being repaired."},{"f":"was / were being + V3","vi":"The road was being fixed."},{"f":"get + V3 (thân mật, chuyện xảy ra)","vi":"My bike got stolen."},{"f":"người nhận làm chủ ngữ","vi":"I was given a free coffee."}],"pts":[{"id":"passive-continuous","name":"Passive: continuous","vi":"Is / was being + V3"},{"id":"get-passive","name":"get + past participle","vi":"Get stolen / hurt / married: bị động thân mật"},{"id":"passive-two-objects","name":"Passive with two objects","vi":"I was given… / She was offered…"}],"cast":{"jay":{"name":{"en":"Jay","vi":"Jay"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"apron","top":"#2E2E2E","topShade":"#222222","accent":"#707070","hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#A86F4C","skinShade":"#93603F"},"x":560},"ben":{"name":{"en":"Ben","vi":"Ben"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#5A6B8C","topShade":"#4A5A78","accent":"#4A5F8F","hair":"short","hairColor":"#B8863B"},"x":1040}},"bg":"street","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Hi, Ben! Where's your car?","vi":"Chào Ben! Xe anh đâu rồi?","ipa":["haɪ","bɛn","wɛɹz","jɔɹ","kɑɹ"],"who":"jay","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":3.056,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,0.965],[2,2.225],[3,2.526],[4,2.658]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"It's being repaired. Someone hit it last week.","vi":"Đang được sửa. Tuần trước có người đâm vào.","ipa":["ɪts","ˈbiɪŋ","ɹɪˈpɛɹd","ˈsʌmˌwʌn","hɪt","ɪt","læst","wik"],"who":"ben","ann":{"expression":"sad"},"b":1,"start":3.846,"end":6.926,"timing":[[0,3.846],[1,3.993],[2,4.281],[3,5.446],[4,5.908],[5,6.108],[6,6.234],[7,6.608]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Oh no! Did you get hurt?","vi":"Ôi không! Anh có bị thương không?","ipa":["oʊ","noʊ","dɪd","ju","ɡɛt","hɝt"],"who":"jay","ann":{"expression":"worried"},"b":1,"start":7.716,"end":9.946,"timing":[[0,7.716],[1,7.828],[2,9.149],[3,9.305],[4,9.413],[5,9.593]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"No, luckily. And I was given a free coffee while I waited!","vi":"Không, may quá. Mà trong lúc chờ, tôi còn được mời một cốc cà phê miễn phí!","ipa":["noʊ","ˈlʌkəli","ənd","aɪ","wɑz","ˈɡɪvən","ə","fɹi","ˈkɑfi","waɪl","aɪ","ˈweɪtɪd"],"who":"ben","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":10.736,"end":14.466,"timing":[[0,10.736],[1,11.044],[2,12.246],[3,12.396],[4,12.471],[5,12.683],[6,13.009],[7,13.071],[8,13.296],[9,13.721],[10,13.958],[11,14.046]]},{"k":"n","sec":"hook","parts":[{"e":"It's being repaired"},{"v":": việc sửa xe đang diễn ra, bị động tiếp diễn. "},{"e":"Did you get hurt?"},{"v":": "},{"e":"get"},{"v":" cộng phân từ, bị động kiểu thân mật. "},{"e":"I was given a free coffee"},{"v":": người nhận đứng làm chủ ngữ."}],"b":1,"start":15.106,"end":26.556},{"k":"n","sec":"form","parts":[{"v":"Bị động tiếp diễn chỉ cần thêm "},{"e":"being"},{"v":" vào giữa. Còn "},{"e":"get"},{"v":" thay cho "},{"e":"be"},{"v":" khi nói thân mật, nhất là với chuyện bất ngờ hay không may."}],"b":2,"start":27.546,"end":36.996,"cues":[[1,32.036]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"A new hospital is being built in our town.","vi":"Một bệnh viện mới đang được xây ở thị trấn chúng tôi.","ipa":["ə","nu","ˈhɑˌspɪtəl","ɪz","ˈbiɪŋ","bɪlt","ɪn","ˈaʊɚ","taʊn"],"hl":[[15,29,"k"]],"b":3,"start":37.886,"end":40.016,"timing":[[0,37.886],[1,37.901],[2,38.139],[3,38.676],[4,38.801],[5,39.064],[6,39.339],[7,39.413],[8,39.538]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"I felt like I was being watched.","vi":"Tôi có cảm giác như mình đang bị theo dõi.","ipa":["aɪ","fɛlt","laɪk","aɪ","wɑz","ˈbiɪŋ","wɑtʃt"],"hl":[[14,31,"k"]],"b":4,"start":40.656,"end":42.266,"timing":[[0,40.656],[1,40.721],[2,41.008],[3,41.209],[4,41.283],[5,41.459],[6,41.721]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"My phone got broken when I dropped it.","vi":"Điện thoại tôi bị vỡ khi tôi đánh rơi nó.","ipa":["maɪ","foʊn","ɡɑt","ˈbɹoʊkən","wɛn","aɪ","dɹɑpt","ɪt"],"hl":[[9,19,"k"]],"b":5,"start":42.906,"end":44.836,"timing":[[0,42.906],[1,43.056],[2,43.356],[3,43.593],[4,43.968],[5,44.118],[6,44.193],[7,44.581]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"They got married last spring.","vi":"Họ cưới nhau mùa xuân năm ngoái.","ipa":["ðeɪ","ɡɑt","ˈmɛɹid","læst","spɹɪŋ"],"hl":[[5,16,"k"]],"b":6,"start":45.476,"end":47.036,"timing":[[0,45.476],[1,45.586],[2,45.811],[3,46.199],[4,46.511]]},{"k":"e","sec":"examples","en":"She was offered a job in Tokyo.","vi":"Cô ấy được mời làm việc ở Tokyo.","ipa":["ʃi","wɑz","ˈɔfɚd","ə","dʒɑb","ɪn","ˈtoʊkiˌoʊ"],"hl":[[4,15,"k"]],"b":7,"start":47.676,"end":49.526,"timing":[[0,47.676],[1,47.791],[2,47.966],[3,48.366],[4,48.441],[5,48.779],[6,48.879]]},{"k":"e","sec":"contrast","en":"The window was broken.","vi":"Cửa sổ bị vỡ.","ipa":["ðə","ˈwɪndoʊ","wɑz","ˈbɹoʊkən"],"b":8,"start":50.516,"end":51.746,"timing":[[0,50.516],[1,50.626],[2,51.014],[3,51.188]]},{"k":"e","sec":"contrast","en":"The window got broken.","vi":"Cửa sổ bị vỡ mất.","ipa":["ðə","ˈwɪndoʊ","ɡɑt","ˈbɹoʊkən"],"b":8,"start":52.386,"end":53.686,"timing":[[0,52.386],[1,52.484],[2,52.871],[3,53.134]]},{"k":"n","sec":"contrast","parts":[{"e":"Was broken"},{"v":" có thể chỉ một trạng thái: lúc đó cửa đã vỡ sẵn. "},{"e":"Got broken"},{"v":" nhấn vào chuyện xảy ra: cửa bị vỡ, thường là bất ngờ."}],"b":8,"start":54.326,"end":63.166,"cues":[[0,54.326],[1,58.776]]},{"k":"e","sec":"natural","en":"I was given a free coffee.","vi":"Tôi được mời một cốc cà phê miễn phí.","ipa":["aɪ","wɑz","ˈɡɪvən","ə","fɹi","ˈkɑfi"],"b":9,"start":64.056,"end":65.436,"timing":[[0,64.056],[1,64.096],[2,64.271],[3,64.583],[4,64.658],[5,64.871]]},{"k":"e","sec":"natural","en":"A free coffee was given to me.","vi":"Một cốc cà phê miễn phí được đưa cho tôi.","ipa":["ə","fɹi","ˈkɑfi","wɑz","ˈɡɪvən","tu","mi"],"b":9,"start":66.076,"end":67.676,"timing":[[0,66.076],[1,66.139],[2,66.389],[3,66.813],[4,66.976],[5,67.276],[6,67.376]]},{"k":"n","sec":"natural","parts":[{"v":"Khi động từ có hai tân ngữ, như "},{"e":"give"},{"v":", "},{"e":"offer"},{"v":", "},{"e":"send"},{"v":", người Anh thích để người nhận làm chủ ngữ. Câu nghe tự nhiên và gọn hơn."}],"b":9,"start":68.316,"end":77.476},{"k":"n","sec":"mistakes","parts":[{"v":"Xe không tự sửa: bị động tiếp diễn "},{"e":"is being repaired"},{"v":"."}],"b":10,"start":78.466,"end":81.936},{"k":"e","sec":"mistakes","en":"My car is being repaired now.","vi":"Xe tôi đang được sửa.","ipa":["maɪ","kɑɹ","ɪz","ˈbiɪŋ","ɹɪˈpɛɹd","naʊ"],"bad":{"en":"My car is repairing now."},"b":10,"start":82.476,"end":84.176,"timing":[[0,82.476],[1,82.639],[2,82.938],[3,83.076],[4,83.339],[5,83.789]]},{"k":"n","sec":"mistakes","parts":[{"v":"Sau "},{"e":"being"},{"v":" là phân từ: "},{"e":"fixed"},{"v":"."}],"b":11,"start":84.816,"end":87.556},{"k":"e","sec":"mistakes","en":"The road was being fixed when we arrived.","vi":"Lúc chúng tôi đến, con đường đang được sửa.","ipa":["ðə","ɹoʊd","wɑz","ˈbiɪŋ","fɪkst","wɛn","wi","ɚˈaɪvd"],"bad":{"en":"The road was being fix when we arrived."},"b":11,"start":88.096,"end":90.106,"timing":[[0,88.096],[1,88.255],[2,88.468],[3,88.619],[4,88.881],[5,89.306],[6,89.431],[7,89.518]]},{"k":"n","sec":"mistakes","parts":[{"v":"Để người nhận làm chủ ngữ: "},{"e":"She was offered"},{"v":"."}],"b":12,"start":90.746,"end":93.516},{"k":"e","sec":"mistakes","en":"She was offered a job.","vi":"Cô ấy được mời làm việc.","ipa":["ʃi","wɑz","ˈɔfɚd","ə","dʒɑb"],"bad":{"en":"A job was offered her."},"b":12,"start":94.056,"end":95.286,"timing":[[0,94.0